  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "First, make a full copy of the matrix.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 2760,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 83,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "This copy will never be modified.",
      "start_ms": 3240,
      "end_ms": 5580,
      "start_frame": 97,
      "end_frame": 167,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Then store the number of rows and the number of columns.",
      "start_ms": 6140,
      "end_ms": 9800,
      "start_frame": 184,
      "end_frame": 294,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Now scan every cell in the original copy.",
      "start_ms": 10700,
      "end_ms": 13440,
      "start_frame": 321,
      "end_frame": 403,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "If the original cell is not zero, we do nothing.",
      "start_ms": 14080,
      "end_ms": 17940,
      "start_frame": 422,
      "end_frame": 538,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "But when the original cell is zero, we zero the corresponding row in the working matrix.",
      "start_ms": 18440,
      "end_ms": 24660,
      "start_frame": 553,
      "end_frame": 740,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "Then we zero the corresponding column in the working matrix.",
      "start_ms": 25140,
      "end_ms": 28760,
      "start_frame": 754,
      "end_frame": 863,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "That is the complete idea.",
      "start_ms": 28760,
      "end_ms": 31640,
      "start_frame": 863,
      "end_frame": 949,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Read from the copy, write into the real matrix.",
      "start_ms": 32540,
      "end_ms": 35920,
      "start_frame": 976,
      "end_frame": 1078,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Because the discovery source never changes.",
      "start_ms": 36320,
      "end_ms": 38740,
      "start_frame": 1090,
      "end_frame": 1162,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "A zero created by us cannot create a false chain reaction.",
      "start_ms": 39420,
      "end_ms": 44100,
      "start_frame": 1183,
      "end_frame": 1323,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "The code is easy to trust.",
      "start_ms": 44840,
      "end_ms": 46820,
      "start_frame": 1345,
      "end_frame": 1405,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "But the cost is much larger than the information we actually need.",
      "start_ms": 47320,
      "end_ms": 51700,
      "start_frame": 1420,
      "end_frame": 1551,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "We copied every value.",
      "start_ms": 52260,
      "end_ms": 54360,
      "start_frame": 1568,
      "end_frame": 1631,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Even though most of those values are irrelevant to the decision.",
      "start_ms": 54360,
      "end_ms": 58500,
      "start_frame": 1631,
      "end_frame": 1755,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "So let's ask a better question.",
      "start_ms": 59640,
      "end_ms": 61460,
      "start_frame": 1789,
      "end_frame": 1844,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "What information do we truly need to remember?",
      "start_ms": 62400,
      "end_ms": 66020,
      "start_frame": 1872,
      "end_frame": 1981,
      "word_count": 8
    }
  ],
